[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
FilmCraft opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which
needs a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run
FilmCraft under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session filmcraft

FilmCraft renders with Vulkan when a Vulkan driver is installed and
falls back to OpenGL ES (EGL) otherwise.  Sound goes through ALSA's OSS
plugin.  Hardware video decoding is not available on FreeBSD; the
built-in decoders are used.
EOM
}
]
